# Anzrag's Rampage destroys the artifacts its controller does not control and counts every artifact put into a graveyard from
# the battlefield this turn, for any reason: here Bot1's two Black Lotuses, sacrificed to pay for it, and Bot2's Sol Ring and
# Mind Stone it destroys (X = 4). Bot1's own Mox Jet is not destroyed. The top four cards are exiled; of them Bot1 puts
# Llanowar Elves onto the battlefield (the Lightning Bolt and Ragavan stay exiled, the Mountain stays too), it has haste, so it
# attacks the turn it arrives, and it is returned to Bot1's hand at the beginning of the end step.

